Package: vdr-plugin-text2skin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${vdr:Depends}
Suggests: vdr-skin-anthra-1920-fst
Description: VDR plugin that loads and displays text based skins
 This plugin is designed to load and interpret a set of files describing the
 layout of the On Screen Display and to make this "Skin" available to VDR via
 Setup -> OSD in the main menu. It is possible to load more than one
 text-based skin this way and to choose between them while running VDR. All
 skins may be themeable and translateable as the author of the skin wishes.
 .
 The skins are loaded from /var/lib/vdr/plugins/text2skin.
